      "width": 3100,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# \ud83c\udff0 Clash of Clans TH18 Deep RL \u2014 v3.0 Single-Army Specialist & 59-Channel Dedicated Tracker\n\nThis canvas dynamically tracks our **v3.0** neural network architecture, `59 \u00d7 50 \u00d7 50` dedicated composition, heroes, spells & defenses spatial observation tensor, `64-D` live available inventory input (`army_context`), factorized 5-head action space, and single-army specialist performance across all 5 TH18 reference villages.\n- **Codebase Sync Status**: [`321c7b4`](file:///home/robin/Projects/CoC) (2026-10-31 11:16:33 UTC) \u2014 *docs(agents): document mandatory asynchronous background post-task protocol and trim AGENTS.md under 24KB limit*\n\n- **Single-Army Specialist Paradigm**: Each model is trained exclusively for **1 dedicated Army Composition**, reflected in its default filename (`{army_slug}_ep{N}_{pct}pct_{stars}star.pt`) and exported inside the `.pt` checkpoint for automatic loading in the AI Model Tester.\n- **59-Channel Dedicated Spatial Grid + 64-D Live Available Inventory**: Channels `0..4` encode base state & Red Zone; Channels `5..16` dedicate **1 channel per loadout troop/siege/CC**; Channels `17..20` encode friendly heroes; Channels `21..24` encode active spells; Channels `25..33` encode defending CC, heroes, ground and air skeletons; Channels `34..55` dedicate **1 channel per defense type & Clan Castle**; Channels `56..58` encode non-offensive building groups; `army_context (64-D)` encodes live inventory.\n- **Vault Documentation**: [[00_Index_MOC|Vault Map of Content]] \u2022 [[architectures/v3.0_31Ch_PerDefense_SingleArmy_ActorCritic|v3.0 Architecture Spec]] \u2022 [[encodings/Defense_And_Unit_Spatial_Encoding|50-Channel Defense & Unit Encoding Spec]] \u2022 [[decisions/Architecture_Decisions_And_System_Memory|System Memory & ADRs]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-v3_per_defense_31ch",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 3850,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "Model Section: v3.0 \u2014 50-Channel Dedicated CNN & Single-Army Specialist Actor-Critic (15,528 Cumulative Episodes \u2014 ACTIVE)"
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-overview",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 980,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Single-Army Specialist Overview & Lineage\n- **Model Name**: **v3.0 \u2014 50-Channel Dedicated CNN & Single-Army Specialist Actor-Critic**\n- **Architecture**: `v3.0` (`59` Spatial Channels + `64-D` Live Inventory \u2022 `1,375,288` Params)\n- **Dedicated Army Composition**: **`TH18 Thrower + Healer + Totem Smash (Meta)`**\n- **Default Checkpoint Naming**: `thrower_healer_totem_smash_ep{N}_{pct}pct_{stars}star.pt`\n- **Status**: **ACTIVE**\n- **Total Training Episodes**: **`15,528`** (Cumulative)\n- **Peak Record**: **`100%` (3\u2605)** (Return: `+100.70336887985468`)\n- **Latest Checkpoint**: `trained_models/thrower_healer_totem_smash_ep15528_100pct_3star.pt`\n\n#### \ud83d\udd04 Resumed Training Sessions (10 Total)\n| Session | Episode Range | Delta | Peak Result |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Session #1** | `0 -> 1,689` | `+1,689 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #2** | `1,689 -> 1,918` | `+229 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #3** | `0 -> 60` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #4** | `0 -> 1,000` | `+1,000 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #5** | `0 -> 4` | `+4 ep` | `78% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #6** | `0 -> 20` | `+20 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #7** | `0 -> 60` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #8** | `0 -> 6,432` | `+6,432 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #9** | `6,432 -> 6,492` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #10** | `6,492 -> 15,528` | `+9,036 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n\n> **Exported Army Metadata**: Every `.pt` checkpoint stores the full `army` loadout dict (`troops`, `spells`, `heroes`, `hero_equipment`, `siege_machine`, `cc_troops`, `cc_spells`) so the AI Model Tester automatically equips the exact composition the model was trained on."
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-inputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 980,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce5 Dual Input Observation Space\n- **Input 1 \u2014 Spatial Grid (`obs`)**: **`(B, 59, 50, 50)`** (`Ch 0..4` Base + `Ch 5..28` Dedicated Units/Heroes/Spells/Enemies + `Ch 29..49` 21 Defense Types)\n- **Input 2 \u2014 Live Available Inventory (`army_context`)**: **`(B, 64)`** (what troops, spells, heroes, abilities, and siege are still available and in what remaining quantity)\n\n| Ch | Feature Name | Normalization |\n| :-: | :--- | :--- |\n| `0` | **Building HP Ratio** | `hp / 11000.0 across footprint` |\n| `1` | **Defense DPS Threat** | `min(DPS / 750, 1.0)` |\n| `2` | **Town Hall 18 Mask** | `1.0 on TH18 tiles, 0.0 elsewhere` |\n| `3` | **Wall Integrity** | `wall_hp / max_wall_hp` |\n| `4` | **No-Deploy Red Zone** | `1.0 = forbidden, 0.0 = legal deploy` |\n| `5` | **Thrower** | `count / 12.0 on tile` |\n| `6` | **Healer** | `count / 5.0 on tile` |\n| `7` | **Furnace** | `count / 2.0 on tile` |\n| `8` | **Druid & Bear** | `count / 1.0 on tile` |\n| `9` | **Ice Golem** | `count / 1.0 on tile` |\n| `10` | **Super Wall Breaker** | `count / 1.0 on tile` |\n| `11` | **Headhunter** | `count / 1.0 on tile` |\n| `12` | **Balloon** | `count / 1.0 on tile` |\n| `13` | **Archer** | `count / 4.0 on tile` |\n| `14` | **Log Launcher (Siege)** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `15` | **CC Super Yeti** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `16` | **CC Super Valkyrie** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `17` | **Barbarian King** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `18` | **Archer Queen** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `19` | **Grand Warden** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `20` | **Royal Champion** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `21` | **Totem Spell (HP Ratio)** | `hp / max_hp on tile` |\n| `22` | **Rage Spell (Fade AoE)** | `remaining / total across AoE` |\n| `23` | **Poison Spell (Fade AoE)** | `remaining / total across AoE` |\n| `24` | **Skeleton Spell (Fade AoE)** | `remaining / total across AoE` |\n| `25` | **Enemy CC & Guardian** | `min(count / 5.0, 1.0)` |\n| `26` | **Defending Barbarian King** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `27` | **Defending Archer Queen** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `28` | **Defending Grand Warden** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `29` | **Defending Royal Champion** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `30` | **Defending Minion Prince** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `31` | **Defending Dragon Duke** | `1.0 on tile` |\n| `32` | **Enemy Ground Skeletons** | `min(count / 10.0, 1.0)` |\n| `33` | **Enemy Air Skeletons** | `min(count / 10.0, 1.0)` |\n| `34` | **Archer Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `35` | **Multi-Archer Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `36` | **Ricochet Cannon** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `37` | **Cannon** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `38` | **Mortar** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `39` | **Air Defense** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `40` | **Wizard Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `41` | **Super Wizard Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `42` | **Air Sweeper** | `0.25 + 0.75 * (dir_deg / 360.0)` |\n| `43` | **Hidden Tesla** | `1.0 only when revealed, 0.0 hidden` |\n| `44` | **Bomb Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `45` | **X-Bow** | `1.0 = Air & Ground, 0.5 = Ground Only` |\n| `46` | **Inferno Tower** | `1.0 = Single-Target, 0.5 = Multi-Target` |\n| `47` | **Scattershot** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `48` | **Builder's Hut** | `1.0 on alive 2\u00d72 footprint` |\n| `49` | **Spell Tower** | `0.25=Rage, 0.50=Poison, 0.75=Invis, 1.0=EQ` |\n| `50` | **Monolith** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `51` | **Multi-Gear Tower** | `1.0 = Long Range, 0.5 = Fast Attack` |\n| `52` | **Firespitter** | `0.25 + 0.75 * (dir_deg / 360.0)` |\n| `53` | **Revenge Tower** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `54` | **Hot Candle (Crafted)** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `55` | **Clan Castle (Defense)** | `1.0 on alive 3\u00d73 footprint` |\n| `56` | **Storages & Hero Hall** | `hp / max_hp across footprint` |\n| `57` | **Resource Collectors** | `hp / max_hp across footprint` |\n| `58` | **Utility & Other Buildings** | `hp / max_hp across footprint` |"
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-outputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce4 Output Policy & Critic Heads\nFactorized Multi-Discrete Action Space:\n- **Head 1**: `slot_type (7)`\n- **Head 2**: `slot_idx (10)`\n- **Head 3**: `deploy_fraction (5)`\n- **Head 4**: `tile_xy (2500)`\n- **Head 5**: `critic_value (1)`\n- **Critic Head**: `Linear(256 -> 128 -> 1)` scalar state-value estimate $V(s) \\in \\mathbb{R}$.\n\n#### Deployment Dynamics:\n- Multi-unit wave drop via `deploy_fraction_head` ($\\alpha \\in \\{0.0, 0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 1.00\\}$), dropping full squads in a single $0.8\\text{s}$ step!"
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-reward",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf Reward Formulation & Two-Phase Pacing (TH18 Combat v3.0)\n\nCalibrated 100-point dense & milestone reward shaping balancing **Destruction + Core HP Damage** ($50\\text{ pts}$) and **Victory Stars + Town Hall 18 Takedown** ($50\\text{ pts}$):\n\n$$R_t = 0.35 \\cdot \\Delta \\%_{\\text{destr}} + 15.0 \\cdot \\Delta \\text{HP}_{\\text{ratio}} + 12.0 \\cdot \\Delta \\text{stars} + 14.0 \\cdot \\mathbb{I}_{\\text{TH18}} + 0.08 \\cdot C_{\\text{funnel}} - 0.05 \\cdot \\mathbb{I}_{\\text{invalid}}$$\n\n- **Destruction & Core HP Damage**: $0.35\\text{ pts}$ per $1\\%$ destruction ($35.0\\text{ pts}$ max) $+ 15.0\\text{ pts}$ continuous building/core HP pool damage ($50.0\\text{ pts}$ combined).\n- **Stars & TH18 Takedown**: $12.0\\text{ pts}$ per star ($36.0\\text{ pts}$ max) $+ 14.0\\text{ pts}$ dedicated milestone bonus upon destroying Town Hall 18 ($50.0\\text{ pts}$ combined).\n- **Two-Phase Tactical Masking & Normalized Per-Head Entropy (`reg_entropy`)**: Phase 1 deploys frontline troop waves along exterior cardinal funnels (excluding interior teaser holes) before Siege/Heroes; Phase 2 paces Spells (`t >= 40`) and Hero Abilities (`t >= 64`) with `NoOp` waiting and Town Hall spell-halo protection."
    },
    {
