    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-results-matrix",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \u2694\ufe0f Main Performance Metric: Dedicated Army Composition vs. 5 Reference Villages\n\nDeterministic rollout benchmarks evaluated for the model's exported army composition against all 5 Reference TH18 Base Layouts:\n\n| Attack Composition | **Central Box** | **Offset Diamond** | **Anti-Hydra Ring** | **Anti-Fireball** | **Compact Teaser** | **Avg Destruction** | **3\u2605 Rate** |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **TH18 Thrower + Healer + Totem Smash** | `100% (3\u2605)` | `71% (2\u2605)` | `100% (3\u2605)` | `88% (2\u2605)` | `93% (2\u2605)` | **90.4%** | **40.0%** |\n| **Base Defense Rate (Avg)** | **100.0% (3.0\u2605)** | **71.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **100.0% (3.0\u2605)** | **88.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **93.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **Overall: 90.4%** | \u2014 |\n\n- **Overall Matchup Average**: **`90.4% Destruction`** with **`2.4\u2605 Average Stars`**.\n- **Model Checkpoint Tested**: `trained_models/thrower_healer_totem_smash_ep15528_100pct_3star.pt`."
    },
    {
      "id": "v3_per_defense_31ch-curves-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "assets/charts/v3_per_defense_31ch_training_curves.png",
      "x": 30,
